M140 S85 ; set bed temp
M190 S85 ; wait for bed temp
M109 S240 ; wait for extruder temp
G28 W ; home all without mesh bed level
G80 X62.0506 Y47.1854 W125.899 H110.734 ; mesh bed levelling

